    "result": {"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Yerin Blog"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"1497aefb-aff7-50c9-8736-ceb738f657df","excerpt":"Flutter Localization packages flutter_localizations intl easy_localization There are packages for flutter app localization a lot. Just pick one!\nBut if you want…","html":"<h1>Flutter Localization packages</h1>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.flutter.dev/development/accessibility-and-localization/internationalization\">flutter_localizations</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://pub.dev/packages/intl\">intl</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://pub.dev/packages/easy_localization\">easy_localization</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>There are packages for flutter app localization a lot. Just pick one!\nBut if you want to change app name with system preferences, you should change the native code.</p>\n<h1>Android</h1>\n<ol>\n<li>Change android:label in AndroidManifest.xml\n${FlutterProj}/android/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"xml\"><pre class=\"language-xml\"><code class=\"language-xml\"> <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>manifest</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\"><span class=\"token namespace\">xmlns:</span>android</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span>\n    <span class=\"token attr-name\">package</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>com.yerin.xxxx<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n   <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>application</span>\n<span class=\"token attr-name\">-</span>        <span class=\"token attr-name\"><span class=\"token namespace\">android:</span>label</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>xxxx<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"token attr-name\">+</span>        <span class=\"token attr-name\"><span class=\"token namespace\">android:</span>label</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>@string/app_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span>\n        <span class=\"token attr-name\"><span class=\"token namespace\">android:</span>name</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>${applicationName}<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span>\n        <span class=\"token attr-name\"><span class=\"token namespace\">android:</span>icon</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>@mipmap/ic_launcher<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n        &lt;activity\n        ...</code></pre></div>\n<ol start=\"2\">\n<li>Create strings files\n${FlutterProj}/android/app/src/main/res/values-en/strings.xml</li>\n</ol>\n<p>or\n${FlutterProj}/android/app/src/main/res/values-de/strings.xml</p>\n<ol start=\"3\">\n<li>Write your app name down!</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"xml\"><pre class=\"language-xml\"><code class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>resources</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n    <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>string</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">name</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>app_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>APP NAME<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>string</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>resources</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span></code></pre></div>\n<h1>iOS</h1>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Open Xcode!\nIn ios folder, there is Xcode file which has <code class=\"language-text\">xcodeproj</code> extension.\n<strong>Remember! If you don’t create strings with Xcode, that files couldn’t add properly into the project.</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Add languages what you want to support.\n<span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/72426a2c338421fe14fb1b758570e4e0/8bd7d/FlutterAppNameI18N_1.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 52.53164556962025%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"FlutterAppNameI18N_1\"\n        title=\"FlutterAppNameI18N_1\"\n        src=\"/static/72426a2c338421fe14fb1b758570e4e0/f058b/FlutterAppNameI18N_1.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/72426a2c338421fe14fb1b758570e4e0/c26ae/FlutterAppNameI18N_1.png 158w,\n/static/72426a2c338421fe14fb1b758570e4e0/6bdcf/FlutterAppNameI18N_1.png 315w,\n/static/72426a2c338421fe14fb1b758570e4e0/f058b/FlutterAppNameI18N_1.png 630w,\n/static/72426a2c338421fe14fb1b758570e4e0/40601/FlutterAppNameI18N_1.png 945w,\n/static/72426a2c338421fe14fb1b758570e4e0/78612/FlutterAppNameI18N_1.png 1260w,\n/static/72426a2c338421fe14fb1b758570e4e0/8bd7d/FlutterAppNameI18N_1.png 2358w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Create InfoPlist.strings in Runner.\n<span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/b4375c05cc43000b0e994f174f9f7273/9ab1f/FlutterAppNameI18N_2.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 37.34177215189873%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"FlutterAppNameI18N_2\"\n        title=\"FlutterAppNameI18N_2\"\n        src=\"/static/b4375c05cc43000b0e994f174f9f7273/f058b/FlutterAppNameI18N_2.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/b4375c05cc43000b0e994f174f9f7273/c26ae/FlutterAppNameI18N_2.png 158w,\n/static/b4375c05cc43000b0e994f174f9f7273/6bdcf/FlutterAppNameI18N_2.png 315w,\n/static/b4375c05cc43000b0e994f174f9f7273/f058b/FlutterAppNameI18N_2.png 630w,\n/static/b4375c05cc43000b0e994f174f9f7273/40601/FlutterAppNameI18N_2.png 945w,\n/static/b4375c05cc43000b0e994f174f9f7273/78612/FlutterAppNameI18N_2.png 1260w,\n/static/b4375c05cc43000b0e994f174f9f7273/9ab1f/FlutterAppNameI18N_2.png 2343w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Create other strings file via clicking <code class=\"language-text\">localize</code> button.\n<span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/abe8b7d49da19dbbf5d04c9869db2365/86177/FlutterAppNameI18N_3.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 32.911392405063296%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"FlutterAppNameI18N_3\"\n        title=\"FlutterAppNameI18N_3\"\n        src=\"/static/abe8b7d49da19dbbf5d04c9869db2365/f058b/FlutterAppNameI18N_3.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/abe8b7d49da19dbbf5d04c9869db2365/c26ae/FlutterAppNameI18N_3.png 158w,\n/static/abe8b7d49da19dbbf5d04c9869db2365/6bdcf/FlutterAppNameI18N_3.png 315w,\n/static/abe8b7d49da19dbbf5d04c9869db2365/f058b/FlutterAppNameI18N_3.png 630w,\n/static/abe8b7d49da19dbbf5d04c9869db2365/40601/FlutterAppNameI18N_3.png 945w,\n/static/abe8b7d49da19dbbf5d04c9869db2365/78612/FlutterAppNameI18N_3.png 1260w,\n/static/abe8b7d49da19dbbf5d04c9869db2365/86177/FlutterAppNameI18N_3.png 2869w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Write your app name down!\n<span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/e4348f3e59b7a209afa4f5f658b7150e/b8765/FlutterAppNameI18N_4.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 34.177215189873415%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"FlutterAppNameI18N_4\"\n        title=\"FlutterAppNameI18N_4\"\n        src=\"/static/e4348f3e59b7a209afa4f5f658b7150e/f058b/FlutterAppNameI18N_4.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/e4348f3e59b7a209afa4f5f658b7150e/c26ae/FlutterAppNameI18N_4.png 158w,\n/static/e4348f3e59b7a209afa4f5f658b7150e/6bdcf/FlutterAppNameI18N_4.png 315w,\n/static/e4348f3e59b7a209afa4f5f658b7150e/f058b/FlutterAppNameI18N_4.png 630w,\n/static/e4348f3e59b7a209afa4f5f658b7150e/40601/FlutterAppNameI18N_4.png 945w,\n/static/e4348f3e59b7a209afa4f5f658b7150e/78612/FlutterAppNameI18N_4.png 1260w,\n/static/e4348f3e59b7a209afa4f5f658b7150e/b8765/FlutterAppNameI18N_4.png 2868w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n</li>\n</ol>","frontmatter":{"title":"Flutter App Name Localization","date":"July 19, 2022","description":null}},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/til/2022-06-21-solidity/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"[TIL] Solidity 02. Syntax"}},"next":null},"pageContext":{"id":"1497aefb-aff7-50c9-8736-ceb738f657df","previousPostId":"04958add-3573-5478-82d9-6939fbd905df","nextPostId":null}},
